cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use BraWl in your research, please cite the associated
  JOSS article, given below as the preferred citation.
type: software
title: BraWl
abstract: >-
  A package for performing lattice-based atomistic simulations
  of alloys with an internal energy given by a Bragg-Williams
  Hamiltonian, implementing Metropolis-Hastings Monte Carlo,
  Nested Sampling and Wang-Landau sampling.
authors:
