repository-code: https://github.com/ChrisWoodgate/BraWl
url: https://chriswoodgate.github.io/BraWl/
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - alloys
  - statistical mechanics
  - thermodynamics
  - Monte Carlo
  - Wang-Landau sampling
  - nested sampling
